<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Preschool Reward System</title>

<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
margin: 0;
font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
text-align: center;
color: #1f1f1f;
background: linear-gradient(120deg, #fff4b8, #dff7ff, #ffe3f1, #e7ffd9);
background-size: 300% 300%;
animation: bgMove 8s ease infinite;
}

@keyframes bgMove {
0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
}

.decor-bg {
position: fixed;
inset: 0;
z-index: -1;
pointer-events: none;
}

.decor {
position: absolute;
opacity: 0.18;
font-size: 55px;
animation: floatDecor 8s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.decor:nth-child(1){ top:10%; left:5%;}
.decor:nth-child(2){ top:20%; right:5%; animation-delay:.5s;}
.decor:nth-child(3){ bottom:15%; left:10%; animation-delay:1s;}
.decor:nth-child(4){ bottom:10%; right:15%; animation-delay:1.5s;}
.decor:nth-child(5){ top:50%; left:40%; animation-delay:2s;}

@keyframes floatDecor {
0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}
50%{transform:translateY(-20px);}
}

.page {
max-width: 750px;
margin: auto;
padding: 20px;
}

.card {
background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
border-radius: 30px;
padding: 25px;
box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
border: 4px solid #24a84a;
}

.logo {
width: 200px;
border-radius: 50%;
margin-bottom: 10px;
animation: floatLogo 3s infinite;
}

@keyframes floatLogo {
0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}
50%{transform:translateY(-8px);}
}

h1 {
font-size: 30px;
color: #168a32;
margin: 10px 0;
}

.subtitle {
font-size: 18px;
color: #444;
margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.bundle-box {
background: #fff7da;
border: 3px dashed #ffad00;
border-radius: 20px;
padding: 12px;
margin: 15px 0;
font-weight: bold;
}

/* FEATURES */
.features {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
gap: 10px;
margin: 15px 0;
}

.feature {
padding: 10px;
border-radius: 15px;
color: white;
font-weight: bold;
}

.feature:nth-child(1){background:#24a84a;}
.feature:nth-child(2){background:#ff8a00;}
.feature:nth-child(3){background:#1e88e5;}
.feature:nth-child(4){background:#e91e63;}

/* ARROWS */
.arrow-text {
font-size: 22px;
color: red;
margin-top: 20px;
animation: glow 1s infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes glow {
from{ text-shadow:0 0 5px red;}
to{ text-shadow:0 0 15px red;}
}

.arrows {
font-size: 40px;
animation: bounce 1s infinite;
}

@keyframes bounce {
0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}
50%{transform:translateY(10px);}
}

/* BUTTON */
.btn {
display: inline-block;
margin-top: 10px;
padding: 18px 30px;
font-size: 22px;
font-weight: bold;
color: white;
text-decoration: none;
border-radius: 20px;
background: linear-gradient(90deg,#ff3b30,#ff8a00,#24a84a);
box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #a93700;
animation: pulse 1.2s infinite;
}

@keyframes pulse {
0%,100%{transform:scale(1);}
50%{transform:scale(1.07);}
}

.note {
margin-top: 15px;
background:#e9f9ee;
padding:12px;
border-radius:15px;
font-weight:bold;
color:#13712a;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="decor-bg">
<div class="decor">⭐</div>
<div class="decor">🏆</div>
<div class="decor">📘</div>
<div class="decor">🎯</div>
<div class="decor">🎨</div>
</div>

<div class="page">
<div class="card">

<img src="logo.png" class="logo">

<h1>Preschool Reward System</h1>

<p class="subtitle">
Complete Learning & Reward System for Ages 2–5
</p>

<div class="bundle-box">
✨ Build habits • Encourage learning • Make activities fun
</div>

<div class="features">
<div class="feature">Reward Charts</div>
<div class="feature">Daily Tasks</div>
<div class="feature">Motivation System</div>
<div class="feature">Printable PDF</div>
</div>

<div class="arrow-text">Click below to get your Reward System</div>
<div class="arrows">⬇️⬇️⬇️</div>

<a class="btn" href="https://www.etsy.com/listing/4498635090/preschool-reward-system-printable-33?ref=shop_home_feat_4&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=shop_home&pro=1&dd=1&logging_key=8fa15dc3de73db808385c8ed9496d35fd7d72941%3A4498635090" target="_blank">
🎯 Get Reward System on Etsy
</a>

<div class="note">
Fun • Learn • Grow 🌈 Perfect for toddlers & preschoolers
</div>

</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
